資料中心業務的實體。母公司於 2004 年 3 月 9 日在馬裡蘭州註冊成立。營運合夥企業於 2004 年 7 月 21 日在馬裡蘭州組成有限合夥企業。"},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, our portfolio included 310 data centers (including 89 data centers held as investments in unconsolidated entities), of which 118 are located in the United States, 113 are located in Europe, 36 are located in Latin America, 16 are located in Africa, 18 are located in Asia, six are located in Australia and three are located in Canada.","zh":"截至2025年12月31日，我們的投資組合包括310個資料中心（包括作為對非合併實體投資而持有的89個資料中心），其中118個位於美國，113個位於歐洲，36個位於拉丁美洲，16個位於非洲，18個位於亞洲，6個位於澳大利亞，3個位於加拿大。"},{"en":"The digital economy continues to grow and change how enterprises across all industries create and deliver value. Companies increasingly need to operate ubiquitously, on-demand and with real-time intelligence serving customers, partners and employees across multiple channels, business functions and points of business presence. Computational processing power requirements continue to advance, data traffic is growing, and the volume of data that enterprises generate, transmit, process, analyze, monitor and manage is expanding dramatically. The Internet of Things, 5G, autonomous vehicles and artificial intelligence, among other technological advancements, are driving this digital transformation.","zh":"數位經濟持續發展並改變各行業企業創造和交付價值的方式。企業越來越需要無所不在、按需營運並提供即時情報，為跨多個管道、業務職能和業務存在點的客戶、合作夥伴和員工提供服務。運算處理能力要求不斷提高，資料流量不斷成長，企業產生、傳輸、處理、分析、監控和管理的資料量急劇膨脹。物聯網、5G、自動駕駛汽車和人工智慧等技術進步正在推動這一數位轉型。"}],"markets":[{"en":"A physical connection between two customer defined end points in a Digital Realty facility enabling customers to directly exchange data.","zh":"Digital Realty 設施中兩個客戶定義的端點之間的實體連接，使客戶能夠直接交換資料。"},{"en":"Dedicated connection enabling rapid data movement between multiple Digital Realty facilities located in the same metro area.","zh":"專用連線可實現位於同一都會區的多個 Digital Realty 設施之間的快速資料移動。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our portfolio has attracted a high-quality, diversified mix of customers. We have more than 5,000 customers, and no single customer represented more than approximately 11.7% of the aggregate annualized recurring revenue of our portfolio as of December 31, 2025.","zh":"我們的產品組合吸引了高品質、多元化的客戶群。我們擁有超過 5,000 名客戶，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，沒有一個客戶占我們投資組合年化經常性收入總額的約 11.7% 以上。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Rental & Other Services","val":5968918000,"zh":"租賃及其他服務"},{"name":"Fee Income & Other","val":143774000,"zh":"費用收入及其他"}],"total":6112692000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3167700000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2945000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":6112692000}},"peers":["EQIX","PLD","CCI","AMT","PSA"]}}